Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是一个发往 port 3000 的请求，这个应用的前端就跑在那里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here is a request to port 3000, where this app's frontend runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:07.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它要两条简报，也拿到了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It asks for two newsletters and gets them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.44,0:00:11.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可你看是谁应答的：uvicorn，也就是 API 的服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But look who answered: uvicorn, the API's server,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:14.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 API 监听的是 port 9000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the API listens on port 9000.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.53,0:00:17.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个应用去年的版本不是这样工作的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last year's version of this app worked differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:23.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的页面直接调用 port 9000，每个回答都带着一张许可条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its page called port 9000 directly, and every answer carried a permission slip:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:25.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,access-control-allow-origin，星号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}access-control-allow-origin: *.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:29.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今年的 API 根本不发这种许可条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This year's API sends no such slip at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:33.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那么，是谁把请求从 3000 送到 9000 的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So who carried the request from 3000 to 9000, and why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.19,0:00:35.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,去年的页面又为什么需要许可？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}did last year's page need permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.07,0:00:39.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把一条聊天消息画成六个编号步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture draws one chat message as six numbered steps:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.91,0:00:44.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,请求、转发、映射进 container、运行函数、响应、显示\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}request, forward, map into a container, run a function, respond, show it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:48.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们加上课上从没画出的一步：第 3.5 步，信使\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We add one step it never draws: three and a half, the courier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:54.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,拉远一点看，这就是课上整个应用的蓝图，还是那三个端口\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Zoom out, and this is the lecture's blueprint for the whole app, with the same three ports.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.09,0:00:57.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上先说应用已经准备好了，接着又承认\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture calls the app ready, then admits:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.73,0:00:59.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其实还没有，我们得把它建出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}well, not really, we need to build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:03.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天我们在你的笔记本上，把右半边建出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today we build the right-hand side, on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:06.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要跟着做，先把两个 repo 都 clone 下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To follow along, clone both repositories,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.33,0:01:09.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,让 Docker 一直开着，再腾出大约 10 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}keep Docker running, and free about 10 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.89,0:01:12.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的 Google 密钥只在聊天的回答上用得到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your Google key matters only for the chat answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:18.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,角落里的进度条标出 README 的哪一步，代码面板标出文件和行号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tracker in the corner names the README step, code panels name their file and lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.74,0:01:22.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,黄色的 your turn 标签表示暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a yellow tag, your turn, means pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.63,0:01:24.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先看这一讲在哪儿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, where this lecture sits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.75,0:01:28.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课程项目已经有了它的机器学习 pipeline\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The course project has its machine learning pipeline;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:32.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还缺的是应用：一个后端 API 和一个前端\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}what is still missing is the app: a backend API and a frontend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.75,0:01:38.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把系统画成一张技术架构图，也就是蓝图，一层一层地画\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture draws the system as a technical architecture, the blueprint, one layer at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:43.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,开发者、用户、GitHub 和 Colab 在云外\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Developers, users, GitHub and Colab sit outside the cloud,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:48.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Vertex AI 在云里，每个箭头都标着它的协议和 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Vertex AI inside, and every arrow is labeled with its protocol and port.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.13,0:01:50.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着是一个 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then come a bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.34,0:01:53.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个存 image 的 registry 和一块持久化磁盘\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a registry of images and a persistent disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:58.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,右边是一个集群：最前面是 NGINX，应用在 3000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On the right sits a cluster: NGINX in front, the app on 3000,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.91,0:02:02.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,API 在 9000，向量数据库在 8000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the API on 9000, the vector database on 8000.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.22,0:02:06.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天，整个右半边都在你的笔记本上跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today, that whole right-hand side runs on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:10.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的目录规则：每个应用一个 Git 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's folder rule: one Git folder per app,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:15.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,src 下每个服务一个目录，secrets 放在 Git 目录之外\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one folder per service under src, and secrets outside the Git folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.93,0:02:20.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,v1 甚至留着空目录，给它不跑的服务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Version 1 even keeps empty folders for the services it does not run;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:23.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,v2 只放它自己的三个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}version 2 holds only its three.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.43,0:02:26.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1、2 步：把两个 repo 都 clone 下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 1 and 2: clone both repositories.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.78,0:02:30.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 写的是 clone 或下载，git clone 是我们的写法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The READMEs say clone or download; git clone is our spelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:32.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，clone 下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and clone them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:34.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步：在 clone 旁边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3: next to the clones,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:37.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自己建好 secrets 和 persistent-folder 两个目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}create secrets and persistent-folder yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.88,0:02:39.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,交给 Linux 上的 Docker 去建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Left to Docker on Linux,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.46,0:02:43.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们会属于 root，container 就没法往里写\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}they would belong to root, and the container could not write there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:46.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的 ml-workflow.json 密钥放进 secrets 目录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your ml-workflow key goes into secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.45,0:02:51.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一件事在我们录制当天变了：v2 的 main 分支动了两次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One thing changed on the day we recorded: the main branch of version 2 moved twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.23,0:02:54.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们跟着你今天 clone 到的 main 分支走\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We follow main as you clone it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:57.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上讲的简单前端\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The simple frontend the lecture
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:03:02.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在在 2025 分支上，我们最后会去看\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}teaches now sits on a branch called 2025, which we visit at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.37,0:03:07.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,浏览器发出一个请求，服务器回一个响应\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A browser sends a request; a server sends a response.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:10.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,由 port 决定交给哪个程序\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A port picks which program gets it:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:15.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,公开网站在地址里省掉默认的 80 和 443\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}public sites leave the default 80 and 443 out of the address;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:16.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的地址会写出 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}ours show the port.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:21.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这门课里，API 指的是 REST API，用 FastAPI 来写\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In this course, an API means a REST API, built with FastAPI.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:24.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个客户端都只和这一个 API 打交道\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every client talks to that one API,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.71,0:03:27.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也只有 API 和各个存储打交道\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and only the API talks to the stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:29.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 部分，cheese-app-v1\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 1, cheese-app-v1.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:32.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：进到 API 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: go to the API folder;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.37,0:03:35.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的路径漏了 src，所以这一步会失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the README's path misses src, so this fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:38.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：加上 src\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: add src.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:41.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：sh docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: sh docker-shell.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:47.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它先构建 image，再启动一个退出时自动删除的 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It builds the image, then starts a container that removes itself on exit,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.53,0:03:51.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,挂载你的代码，并把 port 9000 发布到 9000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}mounts your code, and publishes port 9000 to 9000.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.61,0:03:52.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:55.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步：README 里那条长长的 uvicorn 命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3: the README's long uvicorn line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.14,0:04:00.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里 uvicorn 是服务器：port 归它管，HTTP 协议也由它来处理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here, uvicorn is the server: it owns the port and speaks HTTP.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:03.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,FastAPI 是它里面的应用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}FastAPI is the app inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:07.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 api.service:app 是一个地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The phrase api.service:app is an address:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:11.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,api 目录，service.py 文件，app 变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}folder api, file service.py, variable app.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:15.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,参数 --host 0.0.0.0 表示所有网络接口\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}--host 0.0.0.0 means every interface:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.01,0:04:17.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,container 自己的回环地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the container's own loopback,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.47,0:04:21.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有它的网络接口，也就是隧道到达的地方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and its network interface, where the tunnel arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.19,0:04:25.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,参数 --reload 在 api 目录里有文件改动时重启应用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}--reload restarts the app when a file in api changes;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:28.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后那部分把额外的参数往下传\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the last part passes on extra arguments.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:33.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,日志也对得上：0.0.0.0，port 9000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The log agrees: 0.0.0.0, port 9000,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.07,0:04:37.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个监视 api 目录的重载器，startup complete\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a reloader watching api, startup complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:41.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 service.py 里，应用加了 CORS 中间件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In service.py, the app adds CORS middleware,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:46.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个到最后才用得上，还有一个路由：GET / 返回一句欢迎语\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which matters at the very end, and one route: GET / returns a welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.50,0:04:49.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步：打开 localhost:9000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4: open localhost:9000.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:52.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外用 curl 也能看到同样的回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra curl shows the same reply:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.34,0:04:55.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,uvicorn 返回状态码 200，还有那句欢迎语\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}status 200 from uvicorn, and the welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:04:57.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，试一试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:05:00.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是课上的那一趟：转发到发布的 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That is the lecture's trip: forwarded to the published port,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:05.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,映射进 container，函数运行，JSON 再传回来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}mapped into the container, the function runs, and the JSON comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:11.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,提一句：课件把 container 内部标成 localhost:9000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One kind note: the slide labels the inside of the container localhost:9000.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.25,0:05:16.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把它理解成 container 的 port 9000 就好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Take it as port 9000 of the container:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.75,0:05:19.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,uvicorn 监听的是 0.0.0.0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}uvicorn listens on 0.0.0.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:21.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那么，快速测一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So, a quick test.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:25.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果 uvicorn 改成监听 127.0.0.1\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If uvicorn listened on 127.0.0.1 instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:29.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 container 里面用 curl 还能通吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}would a curl from inside the container work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:32.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那你浏览器里的 localhost:9000 呢？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And your browser on localhost:9000?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:46.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 container 里面，可以：它自己的回环地址会应答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside, yes: the container's own loopback answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:47.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从浏览器，不行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From the browser, no:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:51.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,转发过来的请求到达的是 container 的网络接口\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the forwarded request arrives on the container's network interface,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.84,0:05:53.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而那里没人监听\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}where nothing listens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.51,0:05:58.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是 README 写 0.0.0.0 的原因\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That is why the README says 0.0.0.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:06:02.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步：课上把一个路由写成加了装饰器的 Python 函数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5: the lecture writes a route as a decorated Python function.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:05.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 README 里的 square root 函数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Add the README's square_root function
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.40,0:06:07.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加到 service.py 末尾，保存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}at the end of service.py, and save.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:11.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它返回 x 的平方加 y 的平方再开平方根\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It returns the square root of x squared plus y squared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:16.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在服务器的终端里，StatReload 发现了改动，换上一个新的应用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the server's terminal, StatReload sees the change and swaps in a fresh app.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:18.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你什么都没重启\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You restarted nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:21.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 步：打开 square root，带上结尾的斜杠\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 6: open square_root, with its trailing slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.91,0:06:26.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有参数，所以用默认值 1 和 2：5 的平方根\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No arguments, so the defaults 1 and 2 apply: the square root of 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:28.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，试一试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:31.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 7 步：加上 x 等于 2，y 等于 10\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 7: add x=2&y=10.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.17,0:06:38.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,查询字符串填进函数的参数，返回的是 104 的平方根\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The query string fills the function's arguments, and back comes the square root of 104.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:39.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个额外实验\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two extras.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:44.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用字母代替数字，会撞上 float 类型提示，被 422 弹回来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A letter instead of a number bounces off the float type hint with 422.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:51.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不带结尾的斜杠，FastAPI 会返回 307，指向带斜杠的版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without the trailing slash, FastAPI answers 307 and points to the slash version.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:54.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务器日志列出每个请求和它的状态码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The server's log shows each request with its status.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.07,0:07:00.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,200、200、200、422、307\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}200, 200, 200, 422, 307.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:02.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 8 步：打开 /docs\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 8: open /docs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.91,0:07:05.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,FastAPI 从你的代码生成了这个页面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}FastAPI built this page from your code:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:11.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,x 和 y 显示为数字，带着默认值，你还能直接在这里试一次调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}x and y appear as numbers, with their defaults, and you can try a call right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.67,0:07:15.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,类型提示变成了校验，也变成了文档\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The type hints became the validation and the documentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.61,0:07:18.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，在文档页上试一次调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and try one call from the docs page.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:22.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在是 v1 的另一半：一个页面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the other half of version 1: a page.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.74,0:07:24.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把一个页面拆成三块\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture splits a page
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:29.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,HTML 管结构，CSS 管样式，JavaScript 管行为\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}into HTML for structure, CSS for style and JavaScript for behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.30,0:07:33.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 v1 里，index.html 把三样都链接起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In version 1, index.html links all three.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.17,0:07:36.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：进到前端目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: go to the frontend folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:39.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和前面同样的疏漏：加上 src\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Same slip as before: add src.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:43.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2、3 步：暂停一下，运行 sh docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 2 and 3: pause, run sh docker-shell.sh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.78,0:07:47.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后在 container 里跑 http-server\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then http-server inside the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:51.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它在 port 8080 上提供这个目录，缓存时间一小时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It serves this folder on port 8080, with a one-hour cache.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:56.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它打印的地址都在 container 里面；你的笔记本用 8080\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The addresses it prints are inside the container; your laptop uses 8080.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.95,0:07:59.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步：打开 localhost:8080\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4: open localhost:8080.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.07,0:08:04.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是课上的第一趟：请求到达 http-server\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This is the lecture's first trip: the request reaches http-server,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:07.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,传回一个文件，浏览器把它画出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a file comes back, and the browser draws it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:09.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，打开看看\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:21.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外看一眼 main.js：这些播客是示例数据\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra look at main.js: the podcasts are sample data,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.05,0:08:23.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,正常情况下应该来自一个 API\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which would normally come from an API.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:26.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 部分会加上第二趟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 adds that second trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.47,0:08:29.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步：在 index.html 里加一个段落\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5: add a paragraph to index.html.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:33.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,说明一点：README 里的代码片段是一个旧的完整 body\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small note: the README's snippet is an old whole body,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.84,0:08:37.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,贴进去会把页面和它的 script 标签都弄丢\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and pasting it would drop the page and its script tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:39.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只加那个段落\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Add only the paragraph.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:46.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 步：刷新，新文字就出来了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 6: refresh, and the new text appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:49.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改了 main.js 可能需要强制刷新\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Edits to main.js may need a hard refresh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:54.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为 http-server 让浏览器把文件缓存一小时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because http-server lets the browser cache files for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:58.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要收尾，在两个终端里都按 Ctrl-C，再输入 exit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To clean up, press Ctrl+C and type exit in both terminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.11,0:09:03.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这时 container 列表是空的，因为两个都自己删掉了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The container list is then empty, because both removed themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:08.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令 docker system prune 会先问你，所以输入 y 确认\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker system prune asks first, so type y;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:11.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,image 列表显示留下了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the image list shows what stays.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:15.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在是 v2，真正的应用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now version 2, the real app:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:17.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,四个 container，在同一个 Docker 网络上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}four containers on one Docker network.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:21.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Chroma，也就是向量数据库，在 8000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Chroma, the vector database, on 8000;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:23.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个加载器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a loader; the API
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:26.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,API 在 9000；React 前端在 3000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on 9000; and the React frontend on 3000.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:32.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,前置条件：一个启用了 Vertex AI API 的 Google Cloud 项目\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The prerequisites: a Google Cloud project with the Vertex AI API,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:36.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个带 Vertex AI User 角色的 ml-workflow 密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the ml-workflow key with the Vertex AI User role,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:38.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有大约 10 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and about 10 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:41.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有了你的密钥，聊天和 embedding 调用会向你的项目计费\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With your key, chat and embedding calls bill your project.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:47.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如实说一句：我们录制用的密钥文件格式正确，但不属于任何账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One honest note: our recording's key file is well-formed but belongs to no account.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:52.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,凡是不调用 Google 的，都和你那边完全一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Everything that does not call Google works exactly as for you;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:54.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一次 Google 调用会失败，我们会指给你看在哪儿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the first Google call fails, and we show where.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:59.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后一步设置：把你的项目 ID 填进两个 docker-shell 脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last setup step: put your project ID into both docker-shell scripts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们这里显示的是一个占位符\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours shows a placeholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.05,0:10:05.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的第一步：确保向量数据库在跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's first step: make sure the vector database is running.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.19,0:10:11.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：进到 src/vector-db，运行 docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: cd src/vector-db, and run docker-shell.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.10,0:10:13.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:18.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个脚本创建网络，构建加载器，再由 Compose 启动 Chroma\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The script creates the network, builds the loader, and Compose starts Chroma,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.69,0:10:22.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,发布 8000，把数据存在你笔记本上的一个目录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}publishing 8000 and keeping its data in a folder on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.45,0:10:27.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步，在 container 里：下载并加载奶酪书\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2, inside the container: download and load the cheese books.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.87,0:10:34.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一共 11 个文件，每本书一行完成信息，总共 14,356 个 chunk\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Eleven files, one finished line per book, 14,356 chunks in all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.33,0:10:35.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，等你的加载完\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause while yours loads.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:39.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些就是 RAG 那一讲的 chunk 和 embedding\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}These are the RAG lecture's chunks and embeddings,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.34,0:10:41.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是下载来的，不是重新算的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}downloaded, not recomputed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:42.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步：chat\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3: chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.03,0:10:45.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一次 Google 调用，也就是给问题做 embedding\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first Google call, embedding the question,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.80,0:10:48.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里失败了，报错是：Invalid grant: account not found\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}fails here: Invalid grant: account not found.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.11,0:10:53.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有了你的密钥，这里出现的就是一个来自这些书的回答。说明一点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With your key, an answer from the books appears instead. A small note:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:57.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,chat 总是问它自己固定的那个问题，How is cheese made\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}chat always asks its own fixed question, "How is cheese made?",
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.37,0:10:59.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有地方让你输入自己的问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and there is no place to type yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.98,0:11:03.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想问别的，就改 cli.py 里的那一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To ask another, edit that line in cli.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:05.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步：exit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4: exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:09.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Chroma 还在 8000 上跑着，额外跑一次 docker ps 就能看到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Chroma keeps running on 8000, as an extra docker ps shows,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:14.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,网络的电话簿现在也能把它的名字解析成地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the network's phone book now turns its name into an address.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:18.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Backend APIs\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Backend APIs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:22.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在一个新终端里，从 cheese-app-v2 目录开始\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In a new terminal, from the cheese-app-v2 folder:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:27.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步，进到 src/api-service，运行 docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}step 1, cd src/api-service, and run docker-shell.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.91,0:11:29.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一次构建要一阵子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first build takes a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:32.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为有 TensorFlow，所以暂停一下，先把它跑起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because of TensorFlow, so pause and start it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:36.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,横幅给了两个命令：API server 和 pytest\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The banner offers two commands: api_server and pytest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.78,0:11:38.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个脚本会先检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This script checks first:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:41.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果 container 已经在跑，就直接在里面开一个 shell\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}if the container already runs, it just opens a shell in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:45.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,否则，它以只读方式挂载 secrets\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Otherwise it mounts secrets without write access,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.57,0:11:50.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,挂载你的 persistent-folder，发布 9000，再加入网络\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}mounts your persistent-folder, publishes 9000, and joins the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:52.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：API server\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: api_server.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:59.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它和前面那条 uvicorn 命令几乎一样，指向 api.service:app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is almost the same uvicorn line as before, pointing at api.service:app.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.55,0:12:01.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把它启动起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and start it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:03.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Application startup complete 马上就出现了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Application startup complete arrives at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.25,0:12:06.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在它之后，TensorFlow 的输出才出现\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only after it do TensorFlow's lines appear,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.98,0:12:10.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来自一个加载奶酪分类器的后台线程\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from a background thread that loads the cheese classifier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:15.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是设计：模型在加载的时候，API 已经马上能应答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That is the design: the API answers right away while the model loads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.87,0:12:19.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有两个探针告诉你进行到哪一步了：/healthz 和 /readyz\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two probes say how far along it is: /healthz and /readyz.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:25.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步：/healthz 返回 200：进程还活着\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3: /healthz says 200: the process is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.53,0:12:29.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 /readyz 返回 503，CNN model is loading\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}/readyz says 503, CNN model is loading.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.25,0:12:38.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外看一眼：模型只下载一次，存进你的 persistent-folder\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra look: the model is downloaded once into your persistent-folder,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:40.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以后每次启动都复用它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and every start reuses it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.35,0:12:44.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再一个额外实验：v1 的习惯不管用了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Another extra: the version 1 habits fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:46.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,根路径 / 和 /docs 都返回 404\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}/ and /docs answer 404;
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:53.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,浏览器调用的一切都在 /api 下面，只有探针还留在根路径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}everything the browser calls is under /api, and only the probes stay at the root.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.50,0:13:04.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那么，快速测一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So, a quick test.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:07.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在 /healthz 返回 200，/readyz 返回 503\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}/healthz says 200 and /readyz says 503.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.11,0:13:10.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你是重启 container，还是等一等？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Do you restart the container, or wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:22.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,等：大约 9 秒后，/readyz 返回 200\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Wait: about nine seconds later, /readyz says 200:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.75,0:13:25.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型加载好了，Chroma 也有应答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the model is loaded and Chroma answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.97,0:13:28.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,重启只会让加载从头再来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A restart would only start the loading over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:32.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Kubernetes，你会在第 19 讲和第 22 讲里见到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Kubernetes, which you meet in lectures 19 and 22,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:38.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,正好可以用这两个探针：看存活决定重启，看就绪决定放流量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}can use exactly these two probes: restart on liveness, send traffic on readiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.65,0:13:41.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,API 需要哪些路由？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which routes does the API need?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:47.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上从页面出发：简报、播客，还有一个能接收照片的聊天\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture starts from the screens: newsletters, podcasts, and a chat that takes a photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:52.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个页面都需要数据，每一类数据就变成一组路由\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each screen needs data, and each kind of data becomes a group of routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.40,0:13:58.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 service.py 里，简报和播客在 /api 下各有一个 router\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In service.py, newsletters and podcasts get a router each under /api.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:01.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后由一个函数批量生成三个聊天 router\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then one function stamps out three chat routers:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:04.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Ask、Identify 和 Cheese books\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ask, Identify and Cheese books.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.35,0:14:09.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上画了六组；agent 聊天在这个 repo 里没有 router\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture shows six groups; agent chat has no router in this repository.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:15.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上还画了 agent 可以放的三个位置，有没有 MCP 服务都行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture also shows three places an agent can sit, with or without an MCP service.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 一个都没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This repository has none.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:20.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件上那个单文件路由讲的是思路\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the slide's one-file route is the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.04,0:14:24.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 把同一个函数放进一个 router\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The repository puts the same function in a router,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.91,0:14:27.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,挂在 /api/newsletters 下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}mounted at /api/newsletters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:31.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,演示路由：把 README 里的函数加在 get status 后面，保存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Demo route: add the README's function after get_status, and save.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:33.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务器会自己重载\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The server reloads by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:39.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这会再加载一次模型，过一会儿 /readyz 又回到 200\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This loads the model again, and /readyz is back to 200 shortly after.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:44.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后打开 /api 下的 square root：又是 5 的平方根\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then open /api/square_root: the square root of 5 again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:49.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 x 等于 3，y 等于 4，它返回 5.0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With x=3&y=4, it answers 5.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.71,0:14:51.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，两个都试试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and try both.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:54.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,API 文档：搬到了 /api/docs\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}API docs: they moved to /api/docs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.22,0:15:00.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外列一下，能看到全部 25 个操作：就是这棵树的叶子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra listing shows all 25 operations: the leaves of this tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:04.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在文档页里，暂停一下，试试 get newsletters，limit 设成 2\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the docs, pause and try get newsletters with a limit of 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.85,0:15:10.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两条简报以 JSON 返回，最新的在前：课上的例子，现在成了真的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two newsletters come back as JSON, newest first: the lecture's example, now real.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:14.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个不存在的 ID 会得到 404，Newsletter not found\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An unknown ID gets 404, newsletter not found.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.57,0:15:17.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Review the code：README 的表格逐个对应了每个文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Review the code: the README's table maps each file.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.09,0:15:22.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其中 service.py 构建应用，settings.py 放所有设置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}service.py builds the app, settings.py holds every setting,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.24,0:15:27.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,router 里放路由，每种聊天模式一个 utils 文件来干活\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the routers hold the routes, and one utils file per chat mode does the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:32.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的聊天处理函数写着：use Gemini to generate text\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's chat handler says: use Gemini to generate text.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:36.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 repo 里，一个路由开始聊天，另一个路由接着聊\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the repository, one route starts a chat and another continues it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.23,0:15:41.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,真实的路径里带着模式：/api/llm/chats\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The real path names the mode: /api/llm/chats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:44.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,API 是怎么记住一段对话的？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}How does the API remember a conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.18,0:15:49.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它不记：每发一条消息，浏览器都会带上一个 session ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It does not: with every message, the browser sends a session ID,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:52.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个浏览器一个随机的 UUID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one random UUID per browser.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.37,0:15:55.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,API 打开这个 session 的聊天文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The API opens that session's chat file,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:58.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加上你的消息和回复，保存，然后就忘掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}adds your message and the reply, saves, and forgets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.05,0:16:04.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个额外实验：没有 session ID，或者消息为空，都会得到 422\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two extras: no session ID, or an empty message, gets 422.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:16.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Identify 的识图这一步完全离线\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Identify's photo step works fully offline.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.65,0:16:20.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们发送 repo 自带的那张蓝纹奶酪照片\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We send the repository's own blue cheese photo,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.23,0:16:23.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CNN 猜的是 parmigiano，58%\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the CNN guesses parmigiano, at 58 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.05,0:16:26.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,追问会交给 Gemini\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A follow-up question would go to Gemini.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.97,0:16:29.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外列一下，就能在磁盘上看到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra listing shows it on disk:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:32.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的 session 下每个聊天一个 JSON 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one JSON file per chat under your session,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.27,0:16:35.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照片在这个模式的 images 目录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the photo in the mode's images folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.48,0:16:38.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Ask 模式会调用 Gemini，到这里就停了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ask mode calls Gemini, and here it stops:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:41.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Internal Server Error，状态码 500\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Internal Server Error, status 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.61,0:16:43.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,API 的终端说明了原因，报错还是那个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The API's terminal shows why:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:46.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Invalid grant: account not found\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the same Invalid grant: account not found.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:49.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有了你的密钥，Gemini 的回答就是这个形状\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With your key, Gemini's answer has this shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:51.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,说明一点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small note:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.31,0:16:57.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的表格讲的是 Gemini 返回 403 和 404，报成 502\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the README's table covers Gemini 403 and 404, reported as 502.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.73,0:17:01.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Google 没法用来登录的密钥会更早失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A key Google cannot sign in with fails earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.33,0:17:05.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就是一个普通的 500，所以先看 API 的终端\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as a plain 500, so check the API's terminal first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:07.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再补充 README 的两点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two more README notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:11.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每条消息都从存下来的文件重建对话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each message rebuilds the conversation from the saved file,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.25,0:17:13.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 API 的任何一个副本都能回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so any copy of the API can answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.91,0:17:16.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而用普通 def 写的路由在线程里跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And routes written with plain def run in threads,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:19.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以一个慢的回答不会阻塞其他请求\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so one slow answer does not block the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:21.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后是测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last, the tests:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.03,0:17:24.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第二个终端里，在同一个目录下再运行 docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in a second terminal, in the same folder,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:28.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,会在正在跑的 container 里开一个 shell\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker-shell.sh again opens a shell in the running container.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.85,0:17:31.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行 pytest：26 passed\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run pytest: 26 passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:33.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.17,0:17:34.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,让这个 container 一直跑着\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Keep this container running.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.13,0:17:39.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,API 已经就绪，但还没人能从浏览器里用它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The API is ready, but nobody can use it from a browser yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:44.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第 2 部分，浏览器和 port 3000 说话，那它怎么到达 9000？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In part 2 the browser talks to port 3000, so how does that reach 9000?
